#: .\core\templates\admin\platform_billing.html:65
msgid ""
"Every store carries exactly one plan — a commercial label set by platform "
"staff, here on the tenant's Plan & Billing section or at provisioning "
"(tenant_create --plan). New stores start on Trial."
msgstr ""
"Every store carries exactly one plan — a commercial label set by platform "
"staff, here on the tenant's Plan & Billing section or at provisioning "
"(tenant_create --plan). New stores start on Trial."

#: .\core\templates\admin\platform_billing.html:69
msgid ""
"A plan does not switch any feature on or off by itself: the loyalty and blog"
" toggles are separate per-store flags, also platform-controlled. Changing a "
"plan changes the label and nothing else."
msgstr ""
"A plan does not switch any feature on or off by itself: the loyalty and blog"
" toggles are separate per-store flags, also platform-controlled. Changing a "
"plan changes the label and nothing else."

#: .\core\templates\admin\platform_billing.html:73
msgid "Recording payment"
msgstr "Recording payment"

#: .\core\templates\admin\platform_billing.html:76
msgid ""
"There is no automated platform billing rail yet. Merchants pay the platform "
"outside the system (invoice / bank transfer), and staff record the outcome "
"by setting the tenant's Paid Until date — extend it by the paid period on "
"every renewal. Trials get a term at provisioning (tenant_create --trial-"
"days, default 30); an empty Paid Until means the term never expires."
msgstr ""
"There is no automated platform billing rail yet. Merchants pay the platform "
"outside the system (invoice / bank transfer), and staff record the outcome "
"by setting the tenant's Paid Until date — extend it by the paid period on "
"every renewal. Trials get a term at provisioning (tenant_create --trial-"
"days, default 30); an empty Paid Until means the term never expires."

#: .\core\templates\admin\platform_billing.html:77
msgid ""
"Paid Until is a date, read as inclusive: the term covers that day and lapses"
" the day after. Moving it forward resets the dunning pipeline for the new "
"term — and immediately reactivates a store the billing task had suspended."
msgstr ""
"Paid Until is a date, read as inclusive: the term covers that day and lapses"
" the day after. Moving it forward resets the dunning pipeline for the new "
"term — and immediately reactivates a store the billing task had suspended."

#: .\core\templates\admin\platform_billing.html:81
msgid "What is enforced"
msgstr "What is enforced"

#: .\core\templates\admin\platform_billing.html:84
#, python-format
msgid ""
"A daily billing task walks the estate and notifies the store owner at three "
"points: an expiry warning %(warn)s days before the term ends, an expired "
"notice the day after it lapses, and — %(grace)s days past the term end — "
"suspension. Each stage is sent at most once per term; the expired and "
"suspension notices also copy the platform admins."
msgstr ""
"A daily billing task walks the estate and notifies the store owner at three "
"points: an expiry warning %(warn)s days before the term ends, an expired "
"notice the day after it lapses, and — %(grace)s days past the term end — "
"suspension. Each stage is sent at most once per term; the expired and "
"suspension notices also copy the platform admins."

#: .\core\templates\admin\platform_billing.html:86
msgid ""
"Auto-suspend is ON: stores past the grace period are suspended by the task "
"(reason: billing) and reactivate automatically the moment a renewal is "
"recorded."
msgstr ""
"Auto-suspend is ON: stores past the grace period are suspended by the task "
"(reason: billing) and reactivate automatically the moment a renewal is "
"recorded."

#: .\core\templates\admin\platform_billing.html:88
msgid ""
"Auto-suspend is OFF (notify-only rollout): warnings and expired notices are "
"sent, but nothing is suspended automatically — follow-up is the Suspend "
"action on the Tenants list. Flip TENANT_BILLING_AUTO_SUSPEND to enable "
"enforcement."
msgstr ""
"Auto-suspend is OFF (notify-only rollout): warnings and expired notices are "
"sent, but nothing is suspended automatically — follow-up is the Suspend "
"action on the Tenants list. Flip TENANT_BILLING_AUTO_SUSPEND to enable "
"enforcement."

#: .\core\templates\admin\platform_billing.html:93
msgid "Handling non-payment"
msgstr "Handling non-payment"

#: .\core\templates\admin\platform_billing.html:96
msgid ""
"Suspension (the Tenants list action, or the billing task) marks the store "
"inactive and stamps when and why: 'manual' for operator action, 'billing' "
"for the dunning task. The storefront stops resolving immediately (visitors "
"see store-not-found), WebSocket connections are refused, scheduled jobs skip"
" the store, and the agent gateway no longer serves it. Data is untouched; "
"Activate restores everything."
msgstr ""
"Suspension (the Tenants list action, or the billing task) marks the store "
"inactive and stamps when and why: 'manual' for operator action, 'billing' "
"for the dunning task. The storefront stops resolving immediately (visitors "
"see store-not-found), WebSocket connections are refused, scheduled jobs skip"
" the store, and the agent gateway no longer serves it. Data is untouched; "
"Activate restores everything."

#: .\core\templates\admin\platform_billing.html:97
msgid ""
"Recording a renewal auto-reactivates billing suspensions only — a manual "
"suspension (abuse, legal) is never lifted by bookkeeping. Destroy is "
"separate and irreversible: it drops the store's schema, and only works after"
" 24 hours of suspension. The public and webside tenants are protected from "
"all of it."
msgstr ""
"Recording a renewal auto-reactivates billing suspensions only — a manual "
"suspension (abuse, legal) is never lifted by bookkeeping. Destroy is "
"separate and irreversible: it drops the store's schema, and only works after"
" 24 hours of suspension. The public and webside tenants are protected from "
"all of it."

#: .\core\templates\admin\platform_billing.html:98
msgid ""
"Caveat: suspension takes the storefront down but is not a network cutoff — "
"direct calls to the store's API host still resolve the schema."
msgstr ""
"Caveat: suspension takes the storefront down but is not a network cutoff — "
"direct calls to the store's API host still resolve the schema."

#: .\core\templates\admin\platform_billing.html:102
msgid "Who sees what"
msgstr "Who sees what"

#: .\core\templates\admin\platform_billing.html:105
msgid ""
"Plan and Paid Until are platform-only. They are excluded from the public "
"tenant-resolve payload, and the merchant self-service allowlist withholds "
"every commercial term — a store admin can edit branding and their own "
"credentials, never their plan, term, flags or lifecycle state."
msgstr ""
"Plan and Paid Until are platform-only. They are excluded from the public "
"tenant-resolve payload, and the merchant self-service allowlist withholds "
"every commercial term — a store admin can edit branding and their own "
"credentials, never their plan, term, flags or lifecycle state."

#: .\core\templates\admin\platform_billing.html:109
msgid "Payment rails"
msgstr "Payment rails"

#: .\core\templates\admin\platform_billing.html:112
msgid ""
"The Viva Wallet and Stripe credentials on each tenant are the merchant's own"
