"owner, store staff, or a guest holding the order's UUID) — no raw storage "
"URLs are exposed to the client. 404 unless the receipt is registered with "
"AADE (myDATA): none issued yet, pending, rejected or cancelled, or a store "
"that issues its receipts outside the platform."

